  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.immortal-ardor.classes.rtEATpOBNll9yYi9]{You Will Know Our Names}</p><p>You are under the effects of an embellishment while within a burst of an inscription from an Artifex. This will take one of three forms:</p><ul><li><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Embellishment of Justice</strong>: When an affected ally deals damage to an enemy, they add 5 persistent fire, spirit, force or mental damage to the damage roll, chosen when selecting this embellishment.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Embellishment of Resolve</strong>: When an affected ally receives healing or heals another creature, they gain a +5 status bonus to the amount of hit points healed.</p></li><li><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Embellishment of Courage</strong>: When an affected ally would take damage, they gain resistance 5 to the damage. If multiple types of damage apply, select one.</p></li></ul>"
    },
